Effects of Nuts, Dried Fruits, Dried Seeds and Black Olives as
Enrichment Ingredients on Acrylamide Concentrations in Sweet and
Savoury Biscuits
Maria Alessia Schouten1 · Agnese Santanatoglia2,3 · Simone Angeloni2 · Massimo Ricciutelli2 · Laura Acquaticci2 ·
Giovanni Caprioli2 · Sauro Vittori2,3 · Santina Romani1,4
Received: 3 July 2023 / Accepted: 18 September 2023 / Published online: 28 September 2023
