The Removal Performance of Bio-Sorption on Sunflower Seed Husk
for Copper and Lead Ions from Aqueous Solutions
Noor Alaa Abdulhusain1*, Layla Abdulkareem Mokif 2
Environmental Research and Studied Center, University of Babylon, Iraq
* Corresponding author’s e-mail: nooralaa21@yahoo.com
